Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:10.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:15.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:23.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:28.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:34.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:38.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:43.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:49.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:53.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:56.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:56.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:04.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:09.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:14.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:19.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:30.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:30.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:35.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:38.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:42.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:45.18,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:52.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:03.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:09.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:11.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.37,0:23:16.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳遞這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:20.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:26.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:30.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:34.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:38.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:39.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:42.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 小妹妹啊 你可抓牢了 會掉下去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不怕嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就怕了 那還算什麼英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！我可是要... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 是藍天大地的城堡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(940,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天優惠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你 小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王 萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哎哎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快樂 我最閃亮的小星星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空公主 你要健康成長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:14.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰... 來者何人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子叫卡疤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:28.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快樂 小空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 怎麼了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出...出大事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩了 請加快速度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？你難道想攪和進去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 豁出去了！給你找個能落腳的地方 後面我可就不管了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可抓牢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}我是英雄少女!? Cure Sky來了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 還好... 我還好...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:50.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:56.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放了公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:11.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有你說別跑就不跑了的笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子強啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 好嚇人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可小心點！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:38.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開 讓開 讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給卡疤痛大人讓路！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要阻止他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:00.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,味道還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要攔住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:05:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:22.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把你也給撞飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳馬！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:52.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:01.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫頭！你什麼人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴空萬里的晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:11.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！你的名字我記下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:16.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟需要在你的墓碑上刻下名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:21.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到天堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇哇哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都吃了什麼 會這麼臭！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳咳... 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:43.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,早晚會跟你算這筆帳的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就說再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這個洞是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:07.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不乖一點 再把你關到肥皂泡裡去...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄啊！絕對不會看著正在哭泣的孩子置之不理的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:24.95,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:28.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居... 居然都追到這裡來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:32.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 你也看中這娃的力量了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量？啊！看前面 危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:38.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？前面？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:52.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回爸爸媽媽... 回家裡去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:09.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出口嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸？欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美著迷 文具
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 先要幫奶奶跑完腿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換個靚妝 心情閃亮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}玫瑰香油 肉桂條 青蛙幹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玫瑰香油 肉桂條
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 青蛙幹 這東西哪裡有賣啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 啊啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！啊！啊！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊的！快讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:11:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-哇...   -哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:03.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哦哦哦哦... 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安...安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！抱...抱歉！嚇到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話 我也是大吃一驚！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很偶然地撞上綁架現場 然後去追這娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猛地扎進一個很奇怪的洞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就從天空上 啪地一下 然後咻地... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 欸 這裡怎麼回事？這城市好奇怪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼 那個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難... 難道這裡是魔法的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫停！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-這是... 在做夢啊     -這是... 在做夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:06.21,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是做夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 做夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面 夢中人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫晴雯麗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫真白 虹丘真白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鐵箱子居然在路上跑 夢世界真厲害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這座夢城叫什麼名字啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是天窗市
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}取名方式可能是很單純的哆來咪的索拉梯哆 但湊巧又有聚焦天空的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗市啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？啊 這個啊 莫非是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的！謝謝你撿到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是很重要的手帳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面寫的是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問這個啊？這是藍天大地的文字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（轟隆！）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在夢中 真的什麼都會發生啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我饒不了你 小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,先要把你揍個稀巴爛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:05.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,再帶公主回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來保護你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有那本事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:18.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:29.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搗亂系的網紅主播？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是會痛的 這不是在做夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我照看一下這娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小晴是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一起逃...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:13:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在發抖？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在嘀咕什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓老子把你們一起打飛是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管對手有多強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要貫徹正義直到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來爭取時間！你們快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:35.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:36.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,用挖斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:46.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:55.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂？亂...亂暴？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼... 卡疤痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:03.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱爆了！嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:25.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把那娃娃交出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:30.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你個跑龍套的耍什麼帥？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不快點交出來...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:34.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的對手... 是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:46.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,《我的英雄手帳》？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:50.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:03.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“怕高那還算是什麼英雄"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:07.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“英雄絕對不會看著正在哭泣的孩子置之不理”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:12.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,噗！“絕對要成為英雄哦！”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.09,0:16:15.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄？哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:18.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 走一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:23.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,軟弱無力的傢伙 就該瑟瑟發抖！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就該哭哭啼啼的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:31.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太過分了！快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:52.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 還要裝英雄啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:59.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回爸爸媽媽那裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家裡去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:15.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管對手有多強
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要貫徹正義直到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:12.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:28.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,連通！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:28.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:38.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:55.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:55.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呀呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:45.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 收拾了那丫頭！亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:51.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,高高
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這力量是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:18.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:21.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放馬過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:25.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:35.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:41.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:46.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇哇哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:50.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,強... 強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:57.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:57.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:00.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:18.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！卡疤...痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:27.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:30.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呀呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:35.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.97,0:21:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說... 小晴啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:50.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:56.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:03.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 愛愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變身成為了Precure 嚇我一大跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.94,0:23:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以後打算怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:53.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,當務之急是送這娃娃回家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼送？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:55.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回答得好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:23:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說小晴你不想回家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:00.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:01.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:01.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:03.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄來我家!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
